  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNOPS Reconstruction of schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reconstruction and retrofitting of schools that were damaged by the earthquake, including minimum enabling conditions: access to WASH for girls and boys, disability accessible and friendly, drinking water provision, book corner/library, playground facilities, classroom furniture, connection to electricity by grid or solar power, boundary walls.

Main focus will be on basic schools.</narrative>
  </description>
